    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this immaculate one-bedroom, one-bathroom third floor apartment to the market, ideally located in the ever-popular and highly sought-after development of Fernleigh Drive, Castleknock, Dublin 15. Fernleigh Drive is renowned for its excellent location and strong community atmosphere, offering unrivalled convenience with a host of amenities within walking distance, including schools, shops, bus and train routes, pubs, recreational facilities, and much more. This superb property combines spacious living accommodation with a prime setting, making it an ideal choice for both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\n\nBright, spacious, and beautifully presented, this superb c.50 sq.m 1 bedroom apartment is truly the perfect blank canvas. It features an inviting entrance hallway, a fully fitted kitchen, and a generous living/dining area opening onto a sunny SOUTH-EAST-facing balcony with pleasant green views. There is one double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a fully tiled family bathroom.\n\nNo. 20 H Fernleigh Drive offers a stylish blank canvas for its new owners. Set within a secure gated development, additional highlights include built-in wardrobes,electric storage heaters, communal parking, SOUTH-EAST balcony, and well-proportioned living space. Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors—early viewing is highly recommended. For further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 102 5390 or 01 554 169.\n\nFeatures:\n\n<ul>\n <li>1 Bed/ 1 Bath</li>\n <li>Vacant 3rd floor apartment</li>\n <li>Private SOUTH-EAST facing balcony</li>\n <li>Balcony overlooking the green areas</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>Communal parking</li>\n <li>Management fee c.1,700 p/a</li>\n <li>Perfect blank canvas</li>\n <li>Freshly painted</li>\n <li>Soundproofed</li>\n <li>Insulated ceiling</li>\n <li>New pump</li>\n <li>Situated in a prime location</li>\n <li>Public transport links & schools in close proximity</li>\n <li>Mature, sought after development</li>\n <li>Viewing is highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections: \n\nComing from the Diswellstown Rd Roundabout Turn left into the development for Fernleigh. Continue into Fernleigh Drive and follow the road through the estate. 20 Fernleigh Drive is located behined the gates and apartment H is located on the 3rd floor via stairs."
      },
      {
